%% M6 socket handshake and room authorisation. Editable source for sequence-m6-socket-handshake-rooms.svg / .png.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Customer browser
    participant BFF as Next.js BFF
    participant SG as Socket.IO gateway
    participant JV as JwtVerifier shared lib
    participant KC as Keycloak JWKS
    participant RP as RoomPolicy
    U->>BFF: GET /api/bff/socket-token with session cookie
    BFF->>BFF: read access token from session, server-side only
    BFF-->>U: short-lived token, aud swiftdrop-api
    U->>SG: connect with handshake auth.token
    SG->>JV: verify token
    JV->>KC: fetch JWKS, cached
    KC-->>JV: public keys
    alt signature, issuer, audience or expiry fails
        JV-->>SG: invalid
        SG-->>U: connect_error unauthorized, disconnect
    else valid
        JV-->>SG: Principal sub, roles, merchantId
        SG-->>U: connected
        U->>SG: join user:OWN_SUB
        SG->>RP: canJoin principal, user:OWN_SUB
        RP-->>SG: allow
        SG-->>U: joined
        U->>SG: join user:OTHER_SUB
        SG->>RP: canJoin principal, user:OTHER_SUB
        RP-->>SG: deny, sub differs
        SG-->>U: error forbidden, room not joined
        U->>SG: join dispatch
        SG->>RP: canJoin principal, dispatch
        RP-->>SG: deny, role CUSTOMER
        SG-->>U: error forbidden, room not joined
    end
    Note over U,SG: Anonymous socket with no token: only public tracking rooms.
